# Emeritus of Ideation enters prepared on turn 1 (paid with two Mox Sapphires and a Black Lotus). On turn 3 Bot1 casts the
# Ancestral Recall copy (unprepared now), a Lightning Bolt and a Brain Freeze with storm two on themselves: twelve cards (with the Black Lotus)
# in the graveyard. Attacking, they accept exiling eight of them, and the Emeritus becomes prepared again: a new copy of
# Ancestral Recall sits in exile with the eight cards.

